  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Donor Platform for Rural Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Donor Platform for Rural Development is a network of 34 bilateral and multilateral donors, international financing institutions, intergovernmental organisations and development agencies. Members share a common vision that agriculture and rural development is central to poverty reduction and that sustainable and efficient development requires a coordinated global approach. The Platform provides advocacy and outreach, knowledge management and innovation, and aid effectiveness and benefits developing countries through facilitation and  exchange of development know-how and provides joint advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
